{"vid":"HMzzR8U9eSw","source":"HMzzR8U9eSw.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"Welcome. Today, we are going to talk"},{"t":1.9,"txt":"about a very important topic in health"},{"t":3.6,"txt":"and safety, the responsibilities of the"},{"t":5.9,"txt":"permit issuer and the permit receiver"},{"t":8.5,"txt":"under a permit to work system. Whether"},{"t":11,"txt":"you're preparing for your NEBOSH Diploma"},{"t":14,"txt":"or working on a live construction or"},{"t":16,"txt":"industrial site, this topic is"},{"t":18,"txt":"absolutely critical. So, let's get"},{"t":20.2,"txt":"straight into it. Let's start with the"},{"t":22.5,"txt":"permit issuer, the person who has the"},{"t":24.9,"txt":"authority to issue the permit to work."},{"t":27.6,"txt":"Number one, the permit issuer must"},{"t":30.3,"txt":"conduct a joint inspection of the work"},{"t":32.6,"txt":"site together with the permit receiver"},{"t":35.4,"txt":"before any work begins. Both parties"},{"t":38.2,"txt":"must physically see the area and agree"},{"t":40.6,"txt":"on the conditions. Number two, the"},{"t":43.4,"txt":"issuer is responsible for ensuring the"},{"t":45.8,"txt":"work is properly planned and authorized."},{"t":48.6,"txt":"No work should start without a clear"},{"t":50.4,"txt":"plan in place. Number three, all hazards"},{"t":53.8,"txt":"must be identified and controlled. The"},{"t":56.5,"txt":"issuer must be satisfied that every"},{"t":58.8,"txt":"foreseeable risk has been assessed."},{"t":61.3,"txt":"Number four, the issuer must confirm"},{"t":64.3,"txt":"that all required isolations and safety"},{"t":66.8,"txt":"precautions are completed. This includes"},{"t":69.4,"txt":"electrical isolation, lockout-tagout,"},{"t":72.6,"txt":"and any process isolation needed. Number"},{"t":75.7,"txt":"five, where required, the issuer must"},{"t":78.4,"txt":"ensure a standby man and fire watcher"},{"t":80.7,"txt":"are assigned before the job starts."},{"t":83,"txt":"Number six, the issuer must clearly"},{"t":85.4,"txt":"explain all permit conditions and"},{"t":87.3,"txt":"precautions to the permit receiver. No"},{"t":89.8,"txt":"assumptions, no shortcuts. Number seven,"},{"t":93.3,"txt":"gas testing must be conducted where the"},{"t":95.8,"txt":"work involves confined spaces, hot work,"},{"t":99.2,"txt":"or any risk of flammable or toxic"},{"t":101.5,"txt":"atmosphere."},{"t":102.9,"txt":"Number eight, the issuer must confirm"},{"t":105.6,"txt":"that competent workers are assigned for"},{"t":108,"txt":"the specific job. Number nine, the"},{"t":111.4,"txt":"issuer holds the authority to stop work"},{"t":113.8,"txt":"immediately if any unsafe conditions"},{"t":116.4,"txt":"arise during the job. And number 10,"},{"t":119.7,"txt":"finally, the issuer must ensure the"},{"t":122.1,"txt":"permit is formally closed after the work"},{"t":124.4,"txt":"is completed and the area is left safe."},{"t":127.8,"txt":"Now, let's move to the permit receiver,"},{"t":130.2,"txt":"the person who accepts and executes the"},{"t":132.2,"txt":"work under the permit."},{"t":134.2,"txt":"Number one, just like the issuer, the"},{"t":136.8,"txt":"permit receiver must also conduct the"},{"t":139,"txt":"joint inspection of the work site with"},{"t":141.3,"txt":"the permit issuer before starting."},{"t":143.8,"txt":"Number two, the receiver must understand"},{"t":146.3,"txt":"all permit conditions thoroughly before"},{"t":148.7,"txt":"any work begins. Signing the permit"},{"t":151.2,"txt":"means you understand and accept the"},{"t":153.2,"txt":"responsibility."},{"t":154.8,"txt":"Number three, the receiver must brief"},{"t":157.4,"txt":"all workers through a toolbox talk."},{"t":160.2,"txt":"Every worker on the job must know the"},{"t":162.4,"txt":"hazards, controls, and emergency"},{"t":164.9,"txt":"procedures. Number four, it is the"},{"t":167.7,"txt":"receiver's duty to ensure all workers"},{"t":170.3,"txt":"are using the correct and proper PPE for"},{"t":173,"txt":"the task."},{"t":174.8,"txt":"Number five, where required, the"},{"t":176.8,"txt":"receiver must confirm that a standby man"},{"t":179.3,"txt":"and fire watcher are available and in"},{"t":181.5,"txt":"position. Number six, the receiver must"},{"t":184.6,"txt":"follow all control measures mentioned in"},{"t":187.1,"txt":"the permit. No improvisation, no"},{"t":190.1,"txt":"deviation."},{"t":191.8,"txt":"Number seven, only proper tools and"},{"t":194.5,"txt":"equipment suitable for the job must be"},{"t":196.8,"txt":"used. No makeshift arrangements."},{"t":200.4,"txt":"Number eight, this is very important. If"},{"t":203.2,"txt":"conditions change at any point during"},{"t":205.2,"txt":"the work, the receiver must stop work"},{"t":207.7,"txt":"immediately and inform the permit"},{"t":209.7,"txt":"issuer. Number nine, the receiver is"},{"t":212.9,"txt":"also responsible for maintaining good"},{"t":214.8,"txt":"housekeeping in the work area throughout"},{"t":216.8,"txt":"the job."},{"t":218.1,"txt":"And number 10, once the work is done,"},{"t":220.8,"txt":"the receiver must return to the permit"},{"t":222.8,"txt":"issuer, report completion, and formally"},{"t":225.5,"txt":"close the permit."},{"t":227.1,"txt":"So, to summarize, both the permit issuer"},{"t":229.9,"txt":"and the permit receiver carry serious"},{"t":232.2,"txt":"legal and moral responsibilities under"},{"t":234.8,"txt":"the permit to work system. It is not"},{"t":237,"txt":"just a piece of paper, it is a"},{"t":238.8,"txt":"life-saving document. Always treat it"},{"t":241.7,"txt":"with the respect it deserves. If you"},{"t":244.1,"txt":"found this helpful, please share it with"},{"t":246.3,"txt":"your colleagues and fellow NEBOSH"},{"t":248.5,"txt":"aspirants. For more sessions, contact us"},{"t":251.7,"txt":"on WhatsApp. Take care, stay safe, and"},{"t":255.2,"txt":"we'll see you in the"}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"Welcome."},{"t":0.8,"w":"Today,"},{"t":1.12,"w":"we"},{"t":1.28,"w":"are"},{"t":1.36,"w":"going"},{"t":1.6,"w":"to"},{"t":1.7